<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header-modules') %>

<main class="maintenance-page app-container">
  <header class="maintenance-head">
    <div><span>SYSTEM GOVERNANCE</span><h1>Maintenance Data</h1><p>Controlled reset untuk mengulang siklus sales dan planning tanpa mengubah inventory aktual.</p></div>
    <button id="refresh-maintenance" type="button" class="maintenance-outline">↻ Refresh Status</button>
  </header>

  <section class="maintenance-summary" aria-label="Ringkasan dokumen">
    <article><span>Sales Order</span><strong id="count-salesOrderHeader">—</strong><small>dokumen demand</small></article>
    <article><span>Forecast</span><strong id="count-forecast">—</strong><small>dokumen demand</small></article>
    <article><span>MPS</span><strong id="count-mPS">—</strong><small>master schedule</small></article>
    <article><span>MRP Run</span><strong id="count-mRPRun">—</strong><small>revision planning</small></article>
  </section>

  <section class="maintenance-workspace">
    <header class="maintenance-workspace-head">
      <div><span>SUPER ADMIN · CONTROLLED RESET</span><h2>Reset sumber &amp; planning terkait</h2><p>Forecast/SO tetap tersimpan dan kembali Draft. Hanya lapisan planning yang dipilih yang dihapus.</p></div>
      <div class="maintenance-lock"><b>STOCK PROTECTED</b><small>Receipt &amp; execution tetap utuh</small></div>
    </header>

    <div id="maintenance-alert" class="maintenance-alert" hidden role="alert"></div>

    <section class="maintenance-step">
      <div class="maintenance-step-no">1</div>
      <div class="maintenance-step-body">
        <div class="maintenance-section-title"><div><h3>Pilih sumber demand</h3><p>Pilih satu atau beberapa Forecast/Sales Order yang akan dikembalikan menjadi Draft.</p></div><span id="reset-selected-count">0 dipilih</span></div>
        <div class="maintenance-source-tools">
          <div class="maintenance-segment" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Tipe sumber reset">
            <button type="button" class="active" data-reset-source-type="FORECAST" aria-pressed="true">Forecast</button>
            <button type="button" data-reset-source-type="SALES_ORDER" aria-pressed="false">Sales Order</button>
          </div>
          <label class="maintenance-search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="reset-search" type="search" placeholder="Cari nomor, customer…" autocomplete="off"></label>
        </div>
        <div id="reset-source-list" class="maintenance-source-list" role="listbox" aria-multiselectable="true"><p>Memuat sumber demand…</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="maintenance-step">
      <div class="maintenance-step-no">2</div>
      <div class="maintenance-step-body">
        <div class="maintenance-section-title"><div><h3>Pilih batas penghapusan</h3><p>Lapisan atas otomatis mencakup dependency yang berada di bawahnya.</p></div></div>
        <div class="maintenance-layers">
          <label><input type="checkbox" value="PRODUCTION_PLAN" data-reset-layer><span><b>Production Plan</b><small>Monthly Plan, capacity allocation, recommendation, dan Daily Plan</small></span></label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" value="MRP" data-reset-layer><span><b>MRP &amp; Purchase Suggestion</b><small>Requirement, planned order, pegging, dan saran pembelian</small></span></label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" value="MPS" data-reset-layer><span><b>MPS &amp; RCCP</b><small>MPS schedule, delivery snapshot, RCCP load, dan offset</small></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="maintenance-protected"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><b>Inventory &amp; execution tidak dapat dipilih</b><small>Stock Balance, Stock Movement, Goods Receipt, Production Log, MO/WO berjalan, PR, dan PO tetap dipertahankan.</small></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="maintenance-step">
      <div class="maintenance-step-no">3</div>
      <div class="maintenance-step-body no-border">
        <div class="maintenance-section-title"><div><h3>Preview dampak</h3><p>Preview wajib diperbarui setiap kali sumber atau checklist berubah.</p></div><button id="reset-preview" class="maintenance-outline compact" type="button">Tampilkan Preview</button></div>
        <div id="reset-impact" class="maintenance-impact empty"><p>Belum ada preview.</p></div>
        <div class="maintenance-confirm-fields">
          <label>Alasan reset<textarea id="reset-reason" rows="2" placeholder="Contoh: ulang planning September karena revisi forecast" disabled></textarea></label>
          <label>Konfirmasi<input id="reset-confirmation" type="text" placeholder="Ketik RESET_SELECTED_PLANNING" autocomplete="off" disabled></label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="maintenance-actionbar">
      <p><b>Tindakan permanen.</b> Sistem menjalankan ulang validasi inventory sebelum transaksi disimpan.</p>
      <button id="reset-submit" class="maintenance-danger" type="button" disabled>Reset yang Dipilih</button>
    </footer>
  </section>
</main>

<script id="maintenance-config" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify({ requiresAuth: true }).replace(/</g, '\u003c') %></script>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
